  unitName: Princess Estia
  unitId: 850015
  unitNumber: 8023
  description: Obeying her father's order to flee to safety, Estia followed Xenon's
    lead and stepped foot outside the kingdom's gates for the very first time. They
    barely managed to escape the wrath of the gods by taking shelter in a deserted
    tower, but the chains of destiny bound them to even more misfortune as they soon
    found themselves trapped under an evil witch's curse.
  summonDesc: I'm happy to have met you. <br>You're the second friend I've made!<br>Don't
    leave me, okay?
  fusionDesc: I've never worked so hard.<br>I'll do anything to be less <br>of a
    burden on Xenon.
  evoDesc: I'll acquire the strength to<br>overcome pain and grief.<br>I have to!
